## 5. Паттерны для переиспользования

### 5.1 Dropdown menu pattern
```
<div class="builder-dropdown">
  <button (click)="toggle('name')">Trigger</button>
  @if (open() === 'name') {
    <div class="builder-dropdown__panel">Content</div>
  }
</div>
```
CSS: absolute positioning, min-width 220px, max-height 320px, overflow-y auto.

### 5.2 Template properties panel pattern
```
@if (templateSelected() && template(); as t) {
  <div class="inspector__form">
    <span class="inspector__section-title">Свойства шаблона</span>
    <!-- orientation buttons -->
    <!-- page size buttons -->
    <!-- opacity slider -->
    <!-- toggle switches -->
    <!-- text inputs -->
    <!-- background images -->
  </div>
}
```

### 5.3 Canvas click detection pattern
```typescript
protected onCanvasClick(event: Event): void {
  const target = event.target as HTMLElement;
  if (!target.closest('.block-renderer')) {
    this.canvasClick.emit();
  }
}
```

### 5.4 Visual indicator pattern on canvas
```html
@if (headerText()) {
  <div class="canvas-header-text">{{ headerText() }}</div>
}
```
CSS: `position: relative; z-index: 2; padding; border-bottom: 1px dashed rule;`

